      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/sep/26/mississippi-tasia-fortune-arrest-hanging-staged",
      "description": "<p>Eric Clark, 45, charged with murder as autopsy concludes Fortune was dead days before body discovered in tree</p><p>A third person has been arrested in the death of 29-year-old Tasia Fortune in <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/mississippi\">Mississippi</a>’s capital city, while investigators said they had determined the scene where her body was found hanging had been staged.</p><p>Eric Clark, 45, surrendered to authorities on Friday and was charged with murder, according to the Jackson police department (JPD). Clark was scheduled to make a court appearance on Monday.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/sep/26/mississippi-tasia-fortune-arrest-hanging-staged\">Continue reading...</a>",
